<title>AUSTRALIA: Power Pacific receivers appointed.</title>
<headline>Power Pacific receivers appointed.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coopers and Lybrand said on Friday it had  been appointed receiver and manager to brewing and investment group  Power Pacific Ltd, which was placed into voluntary administration  on July 18.</p>
<p>Power Pacific shares last traded on July 9, closing down 0.7 of a  cent at 4.5 cents before it was suspended at the company's request  pending an announcement over a proposed brewing joint venture in Vietnam.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
